  <item>
    <title>《橘子不是唯一的水果》文本细读：故事之中总有故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69da5050b977fb2c47ac116a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69da5050b977fb2c47ac116a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 11 Apr 2026 13:57:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> 初识温特森：《鲤》杂志的介绍，2010年这本书进入中国</span></p><span></span><h2><span>（错误订正：这里对萨拉沃特森做采访的是于是，不是张悦然）</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="196">3:16</a> 温特森成长的环境：曼切斯特的工业环境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="833">13:53</a> 关于译者 于是</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1229">20:29</a>《橘子》的写作顺序</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1502">25:02</a> 如果读不进去一本书该不该读？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 1985年《橘子》出版的时代背景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1724">28:44</a> 温特森来中国</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1965">32:45</a> 个人际遇遭遇历史脉络：对照阅读《橘子》与《我要快乐不必正常》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2116">35:16</a> 温特森与她最爱的音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2632">43:52</a> 非线性写作与螺旋叙事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2850">47:30</a> 《橘子不是唯一的水果与《奥兰多》</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>歌剧：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Giacomo Puccini Vissi d'arte (from Tosca)</span></p><span></span><p><span>George Frideric Handel （From Alcina） Di',cor mio, quanto t'amai</span></p><span></span><p><span>纯音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Small Mysteries - Leimoti</span></p><span></span><p><span>Miss Moreau - Leimoti</span></p><span></span><p><span>The Sneak-Up - Leimoti</span></p><span></span><p><span>The Weatherman's Affair - Leimoti.</span></p><span></span><p><span>提到的珍妮特温特森的采访：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Desert Island Discs Radio 4, 09 Oct 1994</span></p><span></span><p><span>An Interview with Jeanette Winterson， Believer， 1 Mar 2013</span></p><span></span><p><span>《鲤》杂志的封面</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl0NUs8_yAz0pLhOrE9IU_x1GdJq.png"></figure>]]></description>
