  <item>
    <title>同人文世界：当女作者和女读者以男性角色的剧本相爱</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/683b95b431215eb506b97a86</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">683b95b431215eb506b97a86</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 01 Jun 2025 01:19:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：Marina，俄罗斯文学、戏剧、音乐研究者</span></p><p><span>微博：_·poetufontana·_</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="61">1:01</a> Marina自我介绍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">2:05</a> 女性同人创作者群体对潜在的年轻女性群体的感情世界的影响</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">2:20</a> 代际差异，九十年代末出生女性对同人文的吸收</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="214">3:34</a>.Marina追的第一对cp 福尔摩斯和华生</span></p><p><span>女性读者，女性作者形成的同人文群体</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="249">4:09</a> 因为写作情感关系而互相相识、相爱的女性</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="266">4:26</a> 女性之间通过探讨浪漫关系，形成浪漫关系</span></p><p><span>同人文提供了一个浪漫剧本，在讨论中你了解了另外一个个体</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="326">5:26</a> 我们生活的文学话语体系里，男性角色被赋予更丰富饱满的个性，他们被女性用来练习自己对情感关系的想象</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="376">6:16</a> 女性作者把自己的性格和对关系的期待赋予男性角色</span></p><p><span>同人文互动生态=非竞争性的/良性的生态</span></p><p><span>高密度的关于浪漫关系的讨论</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">8:00</a> 女性角色需要满足“女性化”的期待</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="628">10:28</a> 虚拟的演练场，女性创作主宰的幻想</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="743">12:23</a> 交流浪漫关系会导向真实浪漫关系，关于女性怎么想象浪漫</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="819">13:39</a> 经典文学中，男性创作，男性批评的文学体系</span></p><p><span>网络文学是否是一个女性主场？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="854">14:14</a> 处理真实的人和人的关系反而是从网文中学会的</span></p><p><span>俄国文学：女性读者无法代入</span></p><p><span>“原来我不是这些作品中的主人公”</span></p><p><span>在男性角色的基础上做建构，这些建构属于女性的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="975">16:15</a> 经典文学为我们培养了同人小说的土壤</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1031">17:11</a></span></p><p><span>“仅仅使用他们的语言不意味着我们传承了他们的脉络”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">17:50</a> 同人文把经典文学改造得更适合当代人语境</span></p><p><span>更关注当代的议题：经典文学里面人和人的互动不再适用当代人</span></p><p><span>同人文更实际、对权力不平等更敏感</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1172">19:32</a> 同人文对语境的修改是被鼓励的</span></p><p><span>创作者享受新世界观对角色关系的碰撞</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1232">20:32</a> 读者也更接受这样的改造</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1279">21:19</a> 跟女性建立亲密关系，通过欣赏对方写作中细微的部分</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1354">22:34</a> 和伴侣会交换同人文bl阅读经验吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1375">22:55</a> 越过了对CP本身的爱 爱上了对方</span></p><p><span>同人女的友谊：慷慨的友谊，心无芥蒂，亲密，高密度</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1430">23:50</a> 建立了脱离文本的联系，保持对对方的关注</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1474">24:34</a> 对作者的兴趣超过了对cp的兴趣</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1535">25:35</a> 同人文创作也处理非常严肃的主题</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1592">26:32</a> 同人文作品对情感生活产生了指导意义？</span></p><p><span>学会了怎么与伴侣的创伤相处</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1705">28:25</a> 从来没有人告诉我具体怎么维护一段关系</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1780">29:40</a> 男性作者创造的浪漫爱：关于男人怎么追求女人，而维护关系是女人的责任</span></p><p><span>经典文学中的女性是被挑选的</span></p><p><span>女性能得到平等的地位是很新的事情，经典文学来不及反应这一点</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1960">32:40</a> 关系更有流动性</span></p><p><span>Abo世界观，是重新分配性别秩序</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2019">33:39</a> 传统经典文学教育遮蔽掉的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2199">36:39</a> 茨维塔耶娃</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2244">37:24</a> 柴可夫斯基</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2379">39:39</a> 文学评价体系如何“常态化”“经典作家” 的“少数”作品</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2492">41:32</a> DH劳伦斯小说</span></p><p><span>《恋爱中的女人》《虹》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2625">43:45</a> 徐𬣙作品</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2735">45:35</a> 俄罗斯经典文学延伸出的庞大的同人文体系</span></p><p><span>经典文学需要我们的翻新</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2791">46:31</a> 结语——歌曲《夜晚》</span></p><p><span>词作者：索菲娅·帕尔诺克&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>曲作者：叶莲娜·弗罗洛娃</span></p><p><span>补充：关于徐𬣙作品的讨论不涉及任何具体作品，是指作家整体对女性关系的塑造而言</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6775b07b15a5fd520e54d5d8/lnQhVAY9JwpJr0D4q5phasyDxwl9.m4a" length="72317857" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:49</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjgM1j5RRyIDBsGK-AHI_BqRcMIM.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>张爱玲和她笔下的民国女校恋情</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6806dbd5cdd692da15d49e6a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6806dbd5cdd692da15d49e6a</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Apr 2025 00:05:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a> Intro</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">1:50</a> 张爱玲的《同学少年都不贱》提到女校里的“拖朋友”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="163">2:43</a> 谢冰莹笔下的“拖朋友”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="265">4:25</a> 《同学少年都不贱》的同性情节：赵钰暗恋的赫素容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="425">7:05</a> &nbsp;赫素容可能的原型：夏孟英</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="806">13:26</a> 赵钰对赫素容的单恋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1351">22:31</a> “境遇性女同性恋”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2080">34:40</a> &nbsp;成年后对赫素容的回想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2113">35:13</a> 芷琪和恩娟似乎有同性倾向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2211">36:51</a> 张爱玲 《同学少年都不贱》创作背景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2388">39:48</a> 张爱玲的另一部同性情节作品&lt;相见欢&gt;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2571">42:51</a> 张爱玲十二岁的第一篇小说《不幸的她》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2983">49:43</a> 一个1932年的女孩子可以在哪里看到女同剧情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2990">49:50</a> 《玲珑》杂志</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3105">51:45</a> 《金发维纳斯》和马琳黛德丽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3235">53:55</a> 越剧舞台上的全女班</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3392">56:32</a> 方青芬对越剧皇帝尹桂芳的回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3500">58:20</a>女同经典桥段“在台上演夫妻”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3525">58:45</a> 冰心在贝满女中的同性经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3595">59:55</a> 和学姐陈克俊演对手戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">1:00:00</a>冰心告诫女生不要学她搞同性恋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3797">1:03:17</a> 凌叔华的同性小说《说有那么一回事》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3910">1:05:10</a> 张元和与凌海霞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4210">1:10:10</a> 1929 陶刘案 因爱生恨的女同性恋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4269">1:11:09</a> 女学生的日记</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4346">1:12:26</a> 回国1914-1939年的知名女校同性恋情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4375">1:12:55</a> 收尾</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>野草闲花逢春生-黄莺莺</span></p><span></span><p><span>State of Zen - Mandala Dreams</span></p><span></span><p><span>Japanese Garden - Sight of Wonders</span></p><span></span><p><span>Loch Lomond- John Kirby and his orchestra</span></p><span></span><p><span>越剧：尹桂芳 李金凤《盘夫》</span></p><span></span><p><span>__</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhVvKrxt_s8vVk0pAyoKfZHKCk9E.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhM5BNPQzRlAzVQv7-EWoxBb0b-F.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FswZg-h2NBYRMRa87B4E5A5iaclQ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;深受女校同学喜爱的民国女作家谢冰莹</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiqvA-CHuCPVNSZ0l7xTL-yz-Aox.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;“小鲁迅”夏孟英</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjd9yRbH3Wj31WanKhtKARkY4xue.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《玲珑》杂志上的女性情侣照片</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjkXW_wCwZB5UsWwQz4GDxB_op63.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;马琳黛德丽《金发维纳斯》中女扮男装的形象</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoigujLUGV4OSIs2FkCuaDpOtG96.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>1936年电影《化身姑娘》的剧照，被刊登在报纸上用于宣传</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtXRn8RqmbcNZbQRsITA_7SFUBQn.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《化身姑娘》里女扮男装的袁美云</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fky5U_HcaDebAQVK2qGoPK84bO6I.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;越剧皇帝 尹桂英</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgBp5FukKGuwqSh0dGvY8Gme9xqL.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1923年大学刚毕业的冰心&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fok10w2KRxJnAX6aPLMLDNRQR-yU.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;晚年的“学姐”陈克俊</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoPbCUuA8q4CS8FgimlN5T9zMRua.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;张元和与凌海霞</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnUb2rEIJ8HBBUPIWehMJqUqLyO3.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;张元和与凌海霞哥哥全家</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuD0XzKfigd-0rP3gKwf_PD6_zYm.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;顾传玠（前排坐）那张让我心生疑虑的照片</span></p>]]></description>
