  <item>
    <title>11.《卡罗尔/盐的代价》文本细读：这些夜晚构成的记忆像一个悬于心上的小岛</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67f298cbf9578163d659e8df</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67f298cbf9578163d659e8df</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 06 Apr 2025 15:16:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> Intro+上一章回顾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="172">2:52</a> 第十七章</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">9:35</a> Carol在整个小说中最脆弱的一幕：被烟烫得流血的嘴角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="709">11:49</a> 你真的想走吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;我当然不想 我只是认为这是最好的办法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="784">13:04</a> 第十七章唯一的结论：Carol发现自己真的需要therese在她身边</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="826">13:46</a> 第18章</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="895">14:55</a> Carol不想两个人有逃亡的感觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="969">16:09</a> 人在爱中，心还会感到恐惧吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1095">18:15</a> 在同性关系中，越往后越感受到外界的压力，反而关系的初期才是彼此之间的张力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1450">24:10</a> 描写酒店环境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1899">31:39</a> 陌生人总是阻止她们独处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2005">33:25</a>“这些夜晚构成的记忆像一个悬于心上的小岛”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2255">37:35</a> 她们距离天堂比人间更近</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2530">42:10</a> Therese终于学开车了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2595">43:15</a> 再见侦探</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3092">51:32</a> 她们的身体像两种原材料，放到一起就会制造欲望</span></p><span></span><p><span>——</span></p><span></span><p><span>两个人住的房间（生成图）：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqLlWs9taPr6ELud1--iDVx4_U-M.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>烤阿拉斯加：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq1EKWFD33zIv-nwGeyqqrAt1P7q.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>背景音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1）Amber Haze——Luba Hillman</span></p><span></span><p><span>2）The Storyteller ——Kikoru</span></p><span></span><p><span>3）Marie——Howard Haper-Barnes</span></p><span></span><p><span>4）The Watchers ——Howard Haper-Barnes</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6775b07b15a5fd520e54d5d8/lqIbRpr7nQau-Ei3vPZDR-iCCGxR.m4a" length="77048321" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:53:05</itunes:duration>
