  <item>
    <title>08.《盐的代价/卡罗尔》文本细读：她是她人生中的假期</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c2e6e3bf52a16cd1d0792f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c2e6e3bf52a16cd1d0792f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 01 Mar 2025 11:00:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>微博：她们_之间 （下划线）</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书/公众号：给陌生人看的日记本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> Intro</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> 第十四章中更加突出两个人“不平等”带来的冲突</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="114">01:54</a> 两个人为旅行准备 ：卡罗尔语气中的“教导”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="241">04:01</a> 菲尔打来的工作电话：特芮丝开始把自己对卡罗尔的情感转移到创作中</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="549">09:09</a> 理查德母亲做的连衣裙：卡罗尔的情绪背后藏着她的不满</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="851">14:11</a> Abby仍然出现在两个人的关系之间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1256">20:56</a> 两个人上路：Carol对细节的关注</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1376">22:56</a> 两个人可以完全忘记钟表时间：同性关系搭建的逃离资本主义社会的乌托邦，和卡罗尔在一起的时间是她人生中的“假期”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1589">26:29</a> “自由，如鲠在喉”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1695">28:15</a> 为后面剧情埋下的伏笔：忘在家里的信</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1842">30:42</a> 两个人喝着黑咖啡的对话：</span></p><span></span><p><span>“好想像沉迷鱼子酱一样过度沉迷”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“习得的习惯总是更加让人愉悦”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“我第一次和你喝咖啡时太紧张了”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2250">37:30</a> 车上的谈话：平常的人是否“无聊”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2384">39:44</a> 荷兰小吃店谈话：卡罗尔对特芮丝真正的不满</span></p><span></span><p><span>“如果你看不见真实的人，你如何进行创造”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“你只是沉迷玻璃的倒影”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2696">44:56</a> 真实的人是谁呢？罗比谢克太太吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3136">52:16</a> 结束语&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6775b07b15a5fd520e54d5d8/loocZ-2te1-OG2-EZhElvL1IF7rF.m4a" length="76956869" type="audio/mp4"/>
