  <item>
    <title>07.《盐的代价/卡罗尔》文本细读：男人和女人多么容易遇到彼此，而她是多么不容易才遇到Carol</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678a4decfd38652366c73b3d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678a4decfd38652366c73b3d</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 17 Jan 2025 12:47:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>微博：她们_之间</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书/公众号：给陌生人看的日记本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> &nbsp;Intro</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> 第十二章开头：一月和新生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">02:25</a> Therese的工作进展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="271">04:31</a> Richard的怀疑，两个人的争吵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="596">09:56</a> Therese开始有了作为“女同性恋”的身份意识：</span></p><span></span><p><span>在酒吧偷偷看一对女同情侣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="715">11:55</a> 和Richard坦白要和Carol去旅行，决定第二天三人碰面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="788">13:08</a> “就像Therese第一眼看到Carol那样”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="915">15:15</a> &nbsp;如何描写爱上一个人的感觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1144">19:04</a> Carol的形象变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1580">26:20</a> 第十三章，理查德：“你为什么那么喜欢她”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">34:10</a> “男人和女人多么容易遇到彼此，而她是多么不容易才遇到Carol”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2235">37:15</a> 一周后Richard再次来</span></p><span></span><p><span>“Carol没有抢走我，因为你从不曾拥有我”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2320">38:40</a> Richard对她们两人关系的偷窥欲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2504">41:44</a> 打碎圣母像：打碎那些旧道德</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2593">43:13</a>和Carol复述这段谈话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2720">45:20</a> 两个人物跳出角色谈论“什么是经典”</span></p><span></span><p><span>经典文学就是关心人类普遍境遇的文学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2845">47:25</a> "我带给她的快乐永远没有她带给我的多”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2946">49:06</a> 从Carol房子里醒来的幸福早晨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3085">51:25</a> Therese变成了房子的另一个女主人</span></p><span></span><p><span>和女仆争夺对Carol的照顾权</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3241">54:01</a> 饭后两个人的聊天，“她用拇指摸着她耳后好像爱抚一只小狗”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3425">57:05</a> “想看你穿条纹夹克衫”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3475">57:55</a> Harge突然再次出现，带着玫瑰花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3769">1:02:49</a> &nbsp;为什么人际关系总是如此，总是没有爽快的结局</span></p><span></span><p><span>不被尊重的女性意志</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6775b07b15a5fd520e54d5d8/lu_3YR40MThrN0RPCpEywnv8d-h8.m4a" length="96654861" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:06:35</itunes:duration>
